# Only the semantic cache is versioned: it holds the LLM extraction of the
# docs, which costs tokens to redo. Everything else here is rebuilt from it and
# the code by `npm run graph:update` (seconds, no LLM) and is machine-local:
# committing it turned every code change into a diff of thousands of lines
# (re-clustered communities, reordered nodes, mtimes).
/*
!/.gitignore
!/cache/
/cache/*
!/cache/semantic/
